  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.34,
      "text": "Most people assume working with AI is a simple transaction."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.12,
      "end": 8.2,
      "text": "You type the perfect prompt, and the AI returns the perfect answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.66,
      "end": 10.02,
      "text": "But that's only the start."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.96,
      "end": 14.24,
      "text": "Think back to the best group project you've ever done in history class."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.88,
      "end": 17.66,
      "text": "Your group didn't start with the perfect finished project."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.22,
      "end": 22.0,
      "text": "You shared ideas, figured out what was missing, and improved it together."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.74,
      "end": 24.76,
      "text": "That's the same way you should work with AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.46,
      "end": 27.86,
      "text": "The group is smaller, just you and the AI,"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.86,
      "end": 30.72,
      "text": "but the best result still takes a conversation."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.68,
      "end": 34.14,
      "text": "There are four distinct moves to this process."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.96,
      "end": 35.58,
      "text": "Thought Partner."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.64,
      "end": 37.34,
      "text": "Learn with AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.34,
      "end": 39.34,
      "text": "Find a place to start."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.32,
      "end": 41.4,
      "text": "Iterate with AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.84,
      "end": 45.64,
      "text": "So, this brings us to our first move, Thought Partner."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.56,
      "end": 49.98,
      "text": "You can really approach this like a two-person group project between you"
    }
  ],
